  sig=func (s *Server) handleWorkspaceSnapshot(w http.ResponseWriter, r *http.Request)
  doc=handleWorkspaceSnapshot takes a named workspace snapshot (POST). One-button\nundo in Prototype and named checkpoints in Engineer/Architect both land here\n(req 14.1). The snapshot.created event is best-effort emitted on the addressed\nconversation's run so it appears in the durable timeline.
EDGES
  ^contains=matrix/cody/internal/server.Server
  ^defines=matrix/cody/internal/server/workspace.go

